WEBVTT

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:32.400
Niche!

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:35.610
Don't go disappearing like that.

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:41.440
Lag, that is not Gauche.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.300
Wait, did you meet Gauche?

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:46.450
That is not Gauche.

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:47.850
He's Noir.

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:50.650
N-Niche, what are you saying?

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:53.060
He said he was Noir himself!

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:55.080
What do you mean?

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:08.970
Gauche got his heart back.

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:10.410
He isn't Noir any...

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.920
Oh, it's you two.

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:15.810
Have you seen a girl around here?

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:18.240
She doesn't say much, and her 
clothes are all tattered...

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:19.550
A girl?

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:21.040
Did something happen?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.730
She said she used to be a dingo, 
so I took her in, but...

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:27.790
Oh, my! What happened to you, Niche?

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:31.790
She didn't fight for real...

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:35.450
Niche, did Roda do that to you?

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:39.040
Was it Roda that took Gauche away?

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:39.880
Roda?

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.350
Roda is Noir's dingo!

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:45.280
He isn't Noir, okay?

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:01.210
What's with that carriage?

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:07.620
Truth and Lies

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:39.100
Noir... I mean, Gauche...

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:41.140
Call me what you wish.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:41.930
But...

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:44.550
It is all right.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:48.330
Even I do not know who I am, after all.

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:12.210
Doctor, should we just let him?

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:16.840
I would have you know that 
this is a medical facility.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:17.920
Oh?

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:22.650
Did I just hear you talking 
back to me, Corpse Doctor?

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:27.670
He ain't anywhere!

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:30.000
The person named Gauche disappeared!

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:31.810
How many times do we have to tell you?

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:35.610
We will be confiscating Gauche 
Suede's medical records.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:42.510
Do you really think that 
Suede's heart has returned?

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:45.510
There are many people who 
believe that to be true.

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:54.480
Move aside.

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:57.060
Master Largo is currently out.

00:04:57.410 --> 00:05:02.070
We are arresting Gauche Suede in the 
name of the Amberground Government!

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:03.570
Where are you hiding him?

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:04.660
Aria?

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:07.850
Niche! Not people!

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:11.240
Aria...-san?

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:22.230
You will pay, beard-brain!

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:26.300
Aria-san, are you okay?

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:26.860
Yes...

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:30.770
You should have already been informed that 
anything concerning Reverse is our jurisdiction.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:35.980
Gauche Suede is no different; we will 
capture him and interrogate him.

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:38.020
Gauche is gone!

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.850
We're searching for him too!

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:40.770
It's the truth!

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:44.270
If I recall, Suede has a sister.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.550
Sylvette doesn't know anything!

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:51.930
Lag, what if Gauche didn't 
really get back his heart...

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:01.330
I will deliver this Gymnopédie to Gauche.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.630
Sylvette doesn't know anything!

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:10.050
And yet they're gonna question her...

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.600
Lag, this way's a shortcut.

00:06:19.050 --> 00:06:21.350
Sylvette Suede, are you in there?

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:22.520
I know you're in there!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:24.810
You're there, I know it!

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:27.870
W-What?

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.430
I-It's me, Sylvette!

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:40.170
Why did you come in from there?

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.060
Sorry, I'll explain later.

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:43.470
Now, take off your clothes!

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:46.290
No, not like that!

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:47.950
Open up!

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:50.650
Those people...

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:54.360
There's no telling what they will do to 
force you to tell them where Gauche is.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:57.430
Anyway, I'll buy you some time...

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:00.580
Your clothes!

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.450
Sylvette Suede, yes?

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:15.100
W-What'll I do...

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.490
I just hope I can pass as 
her body double, but...

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.390
We've got our bait.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:29.330
Oops. We'll be needing this.

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:35.990
Lag...

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:43.730
You got some of the usual in?

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:46.030
Be careful how you use these...

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:47.600
You might get burnt.

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:59.760
Noir isn't the only Marauder in Reverse?!

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:12.590
We'll let you see Gauche Suede real soon.

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:17.430
They know where Gauche is?

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:20.240
But then, why would they 
bring Sylvette with them?

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:35.400
Lawrence...

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:38.070
Is anyone here?

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:58.440
A mirror?

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:02.370
This was Lawrence's room.

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:42.660
One day I, and Lawrence, will surely...

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:02.330
As I figured, you're here.

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:06.090
Noir... Or should I say, Gauche Suede!

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:06.980
Don't move!

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:15.840
Don't worry, you'll be together from now on.

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:19.590
After we kill you, we'll send your 
little sister along to join you.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.300
Kill?

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:23.750
They didn't bring me to interrogate him?

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:26.910
Is that Lawrence's orders?

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:30.250
He says he doesn't need a defective Marauder.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:33.360
We're the only Marauders that Reverse needs!

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:35.400
R-Reverse?!

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:39.490
Lag Seeing?

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:46.820
I see...

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.150
Garrard took Lag.

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:52.600
I apologize for not stopping 
them while you were out, Master.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:54.220
Lag is in trouble.

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:59.700
Why? Those two are quite violent, 
but they're from Akatsuki, right?

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:05.350
They are Reverse Marauders who have 
infiltrated the Amberground government.

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:07.600
Impossible... They couldn't have...

00:11:08.340 --> 00:11:10.430
I should have considered that possibility.

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:12.940
The repeated incidents of stolen letters...

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:16.680
The way those happened meant that far too 
much information had been leaking to Reverse.

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:19.170
But I never would have thought it was them...

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:23.350
Then the reason they're 
searching for Gauche is...

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:25.950
To bring him back by force, or perhaps...

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:28.580
Anyway, Lag is in serious trouble.

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:33.170
He arrived faster than I thought.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:34.900
Impressive, as always.

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:42.710
Jiggy Pepper.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:46.720
Faster than you thought? Who do 
you think you're speaking about?

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:49.420
Oh, ears of the devil you got, buddy.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.840
I have a letter I need express delivered.

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:55.440
What's the address?

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:57.940
To Lag Seeing.

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:06.660
You disappoint me, Lag Seeing!

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:10.190
The fact that you saw through our 
true identities as Reverse Marauders

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:14.380
and went so far as to put on this deception in 
order to expose it to the world is commendable!

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:18.420
Uh, but I was just worried 
about Sylvette, so...

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:21.260
But dressing yourself up so cutesy...

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:23.390
I've completely lost any respect for you!

00:12:24.230 --> 00:12:26.090
You're the disappointment!

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:27.820
I have no use for you.

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:37.560
Niche!

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:39.150
The child of Maka?

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:44.950
Gauche!

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:51.750
Let's go back to where Sylvette is!

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:54.290
Gauche?

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:59.400
Girly! You wanna fight me, right?

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:00.840
Well, come and get me!

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.340
Beard-brain!

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:08.220
Niche!

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:16.140
This cage was made from a gaichuu.

00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:20.110
Even the child of Maka cannot 
cut through it, I see.

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:23.210
Gauche?

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:24.970
I will return to Reverse.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:28.360
I am Noir.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:30.450
What are you up to, Suede?

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:32.180
I don't believe you.

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:35.000
You have gotten your heart back.

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:39.320
I was merely playing the role of Gauche Suede

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:44.050
that was in the memories of 
Lag Seeing's letter bullet.

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:45.470
No way...

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.690
It allowed me to benefit 
from everyone's kindness,

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:51.010
and avoid seeing the tears 
the truth would bring.

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:52.270
That's a lie!

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:53.980
It's not true, Gauche!

00:13:53.980 --> 00:13:56.700
You remembered everything, right?

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:59.800
About Sylvette and Aria-san too!

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:03.410
About the journey the two of us had...

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:07.480
It was all from your memories, Lag Seeing.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:12.070
I recreated the Gauche inside of you.

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:21.710
You said it when you ate Sylvette's soup!

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:27.560
How many years has it been since 
my heart has felt this warmth?

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:33.160
All I did was act the way that the 
Gauche in your heart would have acted.

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:36.500
I had to. No one could 
stand such disgusting soup.

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:45.160
Lag!

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:49.430
Caribs Garrard.

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:57.290
If I get rid of the Letter Bee here, will 
that be proof enough to you that I am Noir?

00:14:58.290 --> 00:14:59.210
Hand me a weapon.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.330
Not a shindanjuu.

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:02.500
A weapon that will actually kill.

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:08.610
That will do.

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:13.260
Why?

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.320
Why, Gauche?

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:18.280
You were supposed to get your heart back...

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.760
A heart, once lost, can 
never be returned, Lag.

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:26.100
Or rather, I do not need a heart.

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:31.450
You must learn that there is something 
more important than heart.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:36.480
I shot into you everything 
I had inside of my heart...

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:41.200
And now you're saying it was 
all for nothing, Gauche?!

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:42.240
Exactly.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:44.770
Heart is powerless.

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:22.200
I have stolen the Letter Bee's life.

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:24.000
Hazle...

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:27.870
Did that second-rate dingo 
kick the bucket too?

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.450
We do some heartless things...

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:35.800
Shindan, Lapis Lazuli?

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:37.220
Jiggy Pepper?

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:44.570
Help has arrived, it seems.

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:47.130
We must hurry to where Lawrence is.

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:15.800
Gauche Suede...

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.840
I'm a first-rate dingo!

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:25.960
Niche...

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:33.980
Jiggy-san, why are you here?

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.330
The Master entrusted me with a delivery...

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:38.070
...addressed to Lag Seeing...

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:49.080
You still wish to be called Noir?

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:51.350
I told you to call me what you will.

00:17:57.770 --> 00:18:00.500
I believed in the letter bullet.

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:05.610
That if I shot my feelings into Gauche, 
his heart would surely return to him.

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.350
But it was powerless...

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:12.510
Gauche... I mean, Noir said so.

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:15.360
He said there was something 
more important than heart.

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:18.300
Gauche would have never 
said something like that.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:20.360
He's...

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:23.550
Gauche wasn't using a shindanjuu, was he?

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:24.640
No.

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:30.960
Wasn't that because he didn't 
want to show you his true heart?

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:36.300
But he tried to kill me!

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:37.480
He really did.

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:43.910
We're almost to Yuusari Central.

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:47.580
Oh, yeah...

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:49.930
The letter from the Master?

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:50.700
Me.

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:54.110
"Use Harry to find where you are located,

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.450
and chase after you to save you."

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:58.500
That's what I was asked to do.

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:07.860
The hearts of the people who wished to see 
your safe return was packed into me, a letter.

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:09.750
And I was sent to you.

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:10.700
Right!

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:20.640
So do you still think that heart 
and letters have no power?

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:46.400
Next: The Lost Shindan
